      "description": "Shows Open Dynamic Workflows and AgentPrism Workflows runs live in Orca's right sidebar, on this computer and on every paired server: phases, every agent as it works, the run's log, tokens, and a notification when a run finishes or waits for you. Read-only. A community plugin, not made or endorsed by Orca or Stably.",
